{"id":"662097","name":"椒盐酥饼","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/662097/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"500g"},{"name":"白砂糖","amount":"10g"},{"name":"酵母粉","amount":"5g"},{"name":"温水","amount":"适量"},{"name":"猪油","amount":"5g"}],"sub":[{"name":"白芝麻","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"先来做油酥，碗内放入面粉和椒盐粉。","img":"images/662097/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"浇入热油。","img":"images/662097/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"调成油酥。","img":"images/662097/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"盆里放入1斤面粉，撒入5克酵母粉和10克白砂糖。","img":"images/662097/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加入适量的温水，搅成面絮状。","img":"images/662097/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"再加入5克猪油，和成光滑的面团。","img":"images/662097/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"面团不用醒发，直接放到案板上。","img":"images/662097/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"擀成长方形的面皮。","img":"images/662097/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"抹上油酥。","img":"images/662097/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"从上往下卷。","img":"images/662097/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"封口后切成小剂子。","img":"images/662097/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"再把小剂子两边的切口封紧。","img":"images/662097/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"做成这样。","img":"images/662097/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"再像做包子一样包圆。","img":"images/662097/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"做好的面团。","img":"images/662097/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"面团表面刷上水，再沾上白芝麻。","img":"images/662097/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"依次全部做好。","img":"images/662097/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"再擀成小饼。","img":"images/662097/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"把小饼入油锅煎。","img":"images/662097/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"一面煎至金黄翻面。","img":"images/662097/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"两面煎至金黄后关火，盖上盖用锅里的余温炕上几分钟再出锅。","img":"images/662097/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/662097/step_22.jpg"},{"step":23,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/662097/step_23.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅、平底锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}